  "description": "Rename/removal detection baseline (CHK-BLD-005, BR-BW-TPL-001/BR-BW-VER-001). tests/test_template_manifest.py diffs the freshly generated template-manifest.json against this file: a name present here and absent from the current manifest, with no deprecated entry covering it, fails CI. This file is updated deliberately, in the same PR as the change that adds a name (append it) or deprecates one (move it, unchanged, into deprecated); it is never auto-regenerated the way template-manifest.json is, because its whole purpose is remembering what existed before this PR.",
